/P 335 0 R
/E (For this capstone project, we will design and implement an end-to-end data engineering pipeline using SQL Server Integration Services \(SSIS\) as the core ETL tool. The project will focus on ingesting, transforming, and loading structured data into SQL Server databases through well-designed SSIS packages.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
869 0 obj
<<
